{%- comment -%}
  Screen: welcome — the approved Portal V2 "RoutineCare benefits" screen,
  shown exactly ONCE, immediately after a customer authenticates for the
  first time in a session (a fresh magic-link handoff, live mode; the
  'openLink'/token mock equivalents). See boot()/bootLive()/openLink in
  subscription-portal.js — a reload of an already-authenticated tab, or any
  ordinary in-portal navigation, goes straight to the dashboard and never
  passes through here again. There is no data-spp-go="welcome" anywhere in
  this theme's regular nav or tab bar, by design.

  Rebuilt field-for-field against the approved Claude Design mockup
  ("VetPets Portal V2", the isWelcome screen), including its real
  "hero-lifestyle" photography (captured directly from the design project's
  own approved assets — see spp-welcome-hero-wide.jpg / -tall.jpg below —
  never a generated or guessed substitute) and its desktop/mobile split:
  a wide 16:9 crop with the delivery card floating over its corner on
  desktop, a tall 4:5 crop with the same card stacked plainly below it on
  mobile. Two departures from the design, both required by what Phoenix
  actually exposes:
  - The lede does not name pets. Phoenix has no pet record (see the
    identical note on spp-screen-dashboard.liquid's own greeting) — a real
    customer must never read a fabricated dog's name.
  - "Skip, pause or adjust anytime" is shortened to "Skip or adjust
    anytime": Phoenix has no pause operation, so the card only promises
    what Skip and Delay can actually do.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="spp__screen" data-spp-screen="welcome" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-wel-h">
  <div class="spp__welcome">
    <div class="spp__pill" data-spp-field="customer.welcomeBack">Welcome back</div>

    <h1 class="spp__h1 spp__welcome-h1" id="spp-wel-h" style="margin-top:10px;">
      Everything included with your RoutineCare membership
    </h1>
    <p class="spp__lede spp__welcome-lede">
      Your daily care is set up and running. This is what your membership quietly
      takes care of between deliveries.
    </p>

    <div class="spp__welcome-hero">
      <picture>
        <source media="(min-width: 700px)" srcset="{{ 'spp-welcome-hero-wide.jpg' | asset_url }}">
        <img
          class="spp__welcome-hero-img"
          src="{{ 'spp-welcome-hero-tall.jpg' | asset_url }}"
          alt="A VetPets member with her dog and the FreshWipes, EyeWipes and EarWipes jars"
          width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </picture>

      <div class="spp__card spp__card--welcome-delivery">
        <div class="spp__eyebrow">Upcoming delivery</div>
        <div class="spp__next-date" data-spp-field="subscription.nextOrderMedium">Tue, Sep 8</div>
        <div class="spp__next-meta">
          <span data-spp-field="pricing.total">$62.73</span> ·
          every <span data-spp-field="subscription.intervalDays">60</span> days · free shipping
        </div>
        <div class="spp__next-thumbs" data-spp-list="lineThumbs">
          <template data-spp-tpl="lineThumbs">
            <span class="spp__thumb spp__thumb--sm" data-spp-thumb><img data-spp-img alt=""></span>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="spp__welcome-grid">
      <div class="spp__welcome-tile">
        <span class="spp__welcome-tick" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 17 %}</span>
        <b>Save 20% on every refill</b>
        <span>Your member price, applied automatically.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spp__welcome-tile">
        <span class="spp__welcome-tick" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 17 %}</span>
        <b>Free shipping</b>
        <span>Every delivery, whatever the order size.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spp__welcome-tile">
        <span class="spp__welcome-tick" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 17 %}</span>
        <b>Skip or adjust anytime</b>
        <span>Move a date or skip a delivery in a couple of taps.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="spp__welcome-tile">
        <span class="spp__welcome-tick" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 17 %}</span>
        <b>Member gifts and surprise treats</b>
        <span>Extras that only go out to RoutineCare members.</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--primary" data-spp-go="dashboard">
      View my subscriptions
      {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 16 %}
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
